  [
    "A\nccording to Table 11.7, the highest proportion of housing units in Sri Lanka consists of permanent housing"
  ],
  [
    "units, accounting for 96.2 percent. When examined by sector, the estate rural sector records the highest"
  ],
  [
    "share of semi-permanent housing units at 14.3 percent. At the district level, the highest proportion of semi-"
  ],
  [
    "permanent  housing  is  reported  in  Moneragala  district  (7.4%).  Relatively  higher  percentages  are  also"
  ],
  [
    "observed in Badulla district (6.5%) and Nuwara Eliya district (6.5%). Furthermore, the highest percentage"
  ],
  [
    "of housing units classified as improvised is reported in Puttalam district (1.5%)."
